  "releaseNotes": "## v3.0 Release - Zero-Regex Architecture & C++20 std::string_view Optimizations\n\n### Key Highlights\n- **Zero-Regex Architecture**: Eliminated CTRE and all runtime regex overhead; pure zero-copy C++20 std::string_view tokenization.\n- **Significant Performance Gains**: Up to +97.5% throughput improvement and 49.3% latency reduction compared to v2.x.\n- **Single Dependency**: Only nlohmann.json is required.\n- **Native NuGet Support**: Restored native NuGet package support for MSVC / Visual Studio C++20 projects.\n\nFor detailed release notes, visit: https://github.com/siddiqsoftware/sip2json/releases",
